		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Re: DM-1701 charger on 12V ?]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4936&amp;p=36685#p36685"><![CDATA[
Just received a 1701 from a vendor in Miami Florida. It has the European wall wart with the round pins, so this package was for export, but I got it 100 miles north of Miami. I have plenty of 14 volt wall warts for Motorola Trbo radios. I notified the seller, &amp; waiting for a reply. I could get a US/European adaptor for $3, but I’m wondering if my 14 volt Moto wall warts could safely be used without causing damage. GARY.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=8235">N4KVE</a> — Thu Apr 10, 2025 3:48 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
